---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
const docUrl = 'https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ZVx55BXqSLXx6rvfMXpPVS4fmolYSdBblVW0kNGaquw/edit?usp=sharing';
---
<Layout title="Regions | Central PA Mesh" description="What MeshCore regions are and how to set them up on a repeater (firmware 1.16+), kept up to date by Central PA Mesh.">
  <SiteHeader base="/" />
  <main class="guide">
    <div class="container guide-inner">
      <h1>Regions</h1>
      <div class="guide-intro">
        <p>Regions don't shrink your reach. They make the mesh work better for everyone. Without regions, every message floods the whole network, even a "good morning" meant only for folks down the road. That uses up airtime on repeaters hundreds of miles away and crowds out traffic that really needs to travel.</p>
        <p>Repeaters just need to know which regions they belong to. The choice of how far a message goes is made on your companion. You can set any channel, including the public channel, to a region so local chatter stays local. Anything you leave unscoped, plus direct messages, still floods the full network just like before. You're in control: keep it local when that's all it needs, or go wide when it matters. The result is less congestion, fewer collisions, and better delivery for everyone.</p>
      </div>
      <h2 class="guide-sub">Setting up regions on a repeater (firmware 1.16+)</h2>
      <p class="guide-note" id="guide-rev" style="color:var(--text-light);font-size:.85rem;margin-bottom:1rem"></p>
      <div id="guide-body" aria-live="polite">
        <p class="guide-loading">Loading guide…</p>
      </div>
      <p class="guide-foot">Need help? Ask in the <a href="https://discord.gg/9wWs3Y7Cx5" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Discord</a> or <a href="https://www.facebook.com/share/g/1E1nHxfQyd/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Facebook group</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <footer>
    <div class="container">
      <img src="/logo.jpg" alt="Central PA Mesh" class="footer-logo" />
      <p>Central PA Mesh · CPAMe.sh<br>Decentralized Communities · LoRa Mesh Networking in Central Pennsylvania</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">
        <a href="https://discord.gg/9wWs3Y7Cx5" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Discord</a> · <a href="/">Home</a> · <a href="/regions">Regions</a> · <a href="/#hardware">Hardware</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>

<script define:vars={{ docUrl }}>
  const body = document.getElementById('guide-body');
  const revEl = document.getElementById('guide-rev');
  fetch('/api/guide/repeater-regions')
    .then((r) => { if (!r.ok) throw new Error(r.status); return r.json(); })
    .then((d) => {
      const rev = (d.title || '').match(/REV:\s*([\d.]+)/i);
      if (rev) revEl.textContent = 'Rev ' + rev[1];
      body.innerHTML = d.html;
      body.querySelectorAll('pre').forEach((pre) => {
        const btn = document.createElement('button');
        btn.type = 'button';
        btn.className = 'copy-btn';
        btn.textContent = 'Copy';
        btn.addEventListener('click', async () => {
          try { await navigator.clipboard.writeText(pre.querySelector('code').textContent); btn.textContent = 'Copied!'; }
          catch { btn.textContent = 'Press Ctrl+C'; }
          setTimeout(() => (btn.textContent = 'Copy'), 1800);
        });
        pre.appendChild(btn);
      });
    })
    .catch(() => {
      body.innerHTML = '<p class="guide-error">The guide could not be loaded right now. You can <a href="' + docUrl + '" target="_blank" rel="noopener">read it directly in Google Docs</a>.</p>';
    });
</script>

<style is:global>
  .guide { padding: 3rem 0 4rem; background: var(--bg-alt); min-height: 70vh; }
  .guide-inner { max-width: 760px; }
  .guide h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 0.6rem; line-height: 1.25; }
  .guide-intro { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .guide-intro p { margin-bottom: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .guide h2.guide-sub { text-align: left; font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 0.3rem; line-height: 1.3; }
  #guide-body { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.75rem; }
  #guide-body p { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  #guide-body h2, #guide-body h3 { color: var(--navy); margin: 1.5rem 0 0.6rem; }
  #guide-body ul, #guide-body ol { margin: 0 0 1rem 1.5rem; }
  #guide-body img { display: block; max-width: 100%; width: auto; height: auto; margin: 1rem auto; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; }
  #guide-body pre { position: relative; background: var(--navy); color: #e6f1ff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem 5rem 1rem 1rem; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; overflow-x: auto; }
  #guide-body pre code { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 0.9rem; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; }
  .copy-btn { position: absolute; top: 0.5rem; right: 0.5rem; background: var(--blue); color: #fff; border: 0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.35rem 0.8rem; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; }
  .guide-foot { margin-top: 1.75rem; text-align: center; color: var(--text-light); }
  .guide-loading, .guide-error { color: var(--text-light); }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .guide h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; } #guide-body { padding: 1.1rem; } }
</style>
